      "writtenOn": "2017-01-11T17:49:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of using regex, perhaps we can use oslo_utils\u0027s timeutils.parse_isotime() and check to see if it raises a ValueError.  This feels odd that we are saying 2017-99-99T99:99:99Z is actually valid.",
